{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同今初難，但彼兼報，今唯約惑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今云本成佛道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今云後起無明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今云一切如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今云何時復生一切煩惱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本來成佛，性德也；異生如來，二脩也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "私註"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圭峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鈔云：世界最初，從心變起，直至成佛，方得終盡。即此計度，是輪𢌞見。"}
